{"id":"n81615-1-12","stage":3,"title":"투자 · 投资","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n81615-1-12-1","ko":"농업 발전을 위해서 정부가 농가 투자를 확대하고 있다던데?","zh":"听说为了发展农业，政府正在加大对农户的投资吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"농업","meaning":"农业","explanation":"농업：农业","readings":[{"term":"농업","audio":"/audio/531e3283fcc33c55ea3a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62413","senseId":"1","lemma":"농업","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"발전을","meaning":"发展","explanation":"발전：发展；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"발전","audio":"/audio/1bc49bf8cde2146a12e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67880","senseId":"1","lemma":"발전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"위해서","meaning":"为了","explanation":"위하다：为了；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"위하다","audio":"/audio/96303fbb42bf3d764fa0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29736","senseId":"3","lemma":"위하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정부가","meaning":"政府","explanation":"정부：政府；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"정부","audio":"/audio/e471387df97978e2d0ff.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31749","senseId":"2","lemma":"정부","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"농가","meaning":"农家","explanation":"농가：农家","readings":[{"term":"농가","audio":"/audio/7d2801413571d7160c28.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43790","senseId":"1","lemma":"농가","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"투자를","meaning":"投资","explanation":"투자：投资；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"투자","audio":"/audio/9e820c811125bbbe5d2d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"81615","senseId":"1","lemma":"투자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"확대하고","meaning":"扩大，拓宽","explanation":"확대하다：扩大，拓宽；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"확대하다","audio":"/audio/722a746a9692fce95443.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73233","senseId":"1","lemma":"확대하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있다던데?","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；다던데：转述听到的情况，并留下确认、补充或对照的语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"531e3283fcc33c55","term":"농업","zh":"农业","audio":"/audio/531e3283fcc33c55ea3a.mp3","entryId":"62413","definition":"农耕之事；或指从事农耕的职业。","pronunciation":["농업"]},{"id":"1bc49bf8cde2146a","term":"발전","zh":"发展","audio":"/audio/1bc49bf8cde2146a12e0.mp3","entryId":"67880","definition":"提升到更好的状态或更高的阶段。","pronunciation":["발쩐"]},{"id":"96303fbb42bf3d76","term":"위하다","zh":"为了","audio":"/audio/96303fbb42bf3d764fa0.mp3","entryId":"29736","definition":"想要实现某种想法或目的。","pronunciation":["위하다"]},{"id":"e471387df97978e2","term":"정부","zh":"政府","audio":"/audio/e471387df97978e2d0ff.mp3","entryId":"31749","definition":"负责行政的国家机构。","pronunciation":["정부"]},{"id":"7d2801413571d716","term":"농가","zh":"农家","audio":"/audio/7d2801413571d7160c28.mp3","entryId":"43790","definition":"从事农耕的人的家庭。","pronunciation":["농가"]},{"id":"9e820c811125bbbe","term":"투자","zh":"投资","audio":"/audio/9e820c811125bbbe5d2d.mp3","entryId":"81615","definition":"为获取利益而向某事或生意投入资金或倾注时间及心血。","pronunciation":["투자"]},{"id":"722a746a9692fce9","term":"확대하다","zh":"扩大，拓宽","audio":"/audio/722a746a9692fce95443.mp3","entryId":"73233","definition":"把样子、规模等变得比原来大。","pronunciation":["확때하다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/64f5cdb597ba614d1474.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n81615-1-12-2","ko":"응, 농업 설비와 품종 개량에 필요한 돈을 지원해 주더군.","zh":"对，他们会为农业设施和品种改良提供所需资金支持。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"농업","meaning":"农业","explanation":"농업：农业","readings":[{"term":"농업","audio":"/audio/531e3283fcc33c55ea3a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62413","senseId":"1","lemma":"농업","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"설비와","meaning":"设备","explanation":"설비：设备；와：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"설비","audio":"/audio/559b648375c61ade2f65.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"90519","senseId":"1","lemma":"설비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"품종","meaning":"品种，种","explanation":"품종：品种，种","readings":[{"term":"품종","audio":"/audio/df78224f9b55b5fa72c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88506","senseId":"2","lemma":"품종","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"개량에","meaning":"改良","explanation":"개량：改良；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"개량","audio":"/audio/90cac8a6779069068276.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23437","senseId":"1","lemma":"개량","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"필요한","meaning":"必需，必要","explanation":"필요하다：必需，必要；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"필요하다","audio":"/audio/b98947c9698402e3d07e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"46945","senseId":"1","lemma":"필요하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돈을","meaning":"钱，钱款，价钱，费用","explanation":"돈：钱，钱款，价钱，费用；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"돈","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17204","senseId":"2","lemma":"돈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지원해","meaning":"支援，援助","explanation":"지원하다：支援，援助；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"지원하다","audio":"/audio/3cc4b662ebfb0cda238a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27943","senseId":"1","lemma":"지원하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주더군.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；더군：回顾亲历的情况并表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"531e3283fcc33c55","term":"농업","zh":"农业","audio":"/audio/531e3283fcc33c55ea3a.mp3","entryId":"62413","definition":"农耕之事；或指从事农耕的职业。","pronunciation":["농업"]},{"id":"559b648375c61ade","term":"설비","zh":"设备","audio":"/audio/559b648375c61ade2f65.mp3","entryId":"90519","definition":"具备必要的东西或设施；或指那样的设施。","pronunciation":["설비"]},{"id":"df78224f9b55b5fa","term":"품종","zh":"品种，种","audio":"/audio/df78224f9b55b5fa72c5.mp3","entryId":"88506","definition":"根据特征划分同一种类生物的单位。","pronunciation":["품ː종"]},{"id":"90cac8a677906906","term":"개량","zh":"改良","audio":"/audio/90cac8a6779069068276.mp3","entryId":"23437","definition":"弥补质量或功能上的缺点，把它改得更好。","pronunciation":["개ː량"]},{"id":"b98947c9698402e3","term":"필요하다","zh":"必需，必要","audio":"/audio/b98947c9698402e3d07e.mp3","entryId":"46945","definition":"一定要有的。","pronunciation":["피료하다"]},{"id":"a5d79d1c30059080","term":"돈","zh":"钱，钱款，价钱，费用","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3","entryId":"17204","definition":"购物或做某事时所需的钱财。","pronunciation":["돈ː"]},{"id":"3cc4b662ebfb0cda","term":"지원하다","zh":"支援，援助","audio":"/audio/3cc4b662ebfb0cda238a.mp3","entryId":"27943","definition":"以物质或行动给予帮助。","pronunciation":["지원하다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d68f946f8b7e6b74b7b8.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":6.538,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=81615","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":119,"sequenceScore":6.3647,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["对，他们会为农业设施和品种改良提供所需资金支持。","听说为了发展农业，政府正在加大对农户的投资吧？","据说警方今天打算把所有正在罢工的工会成员都抓起来。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["听说为了发展农业，政府正在加大对农户的投资吧？","据说警方今天打算把所有正在罢工的工会成员都抓起来。","对，他们会为农业设施和品种改良提供所需资金支持。"],"answer":2}]}
